      "latin": "Wa innahū ‘alā żālika lasyahīd(un).",
      "translation_id": "Sesungguhnya dia benar-benar menjadi saksi atas hal itu (keingkarannya).",
      "translation_en": "And indeed, he is to that a witness.",
      "audio": {
        "01": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdullah-Al-Juhany/100007.mp3",
        "02": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdul-Muhsin-Al-Qasim/100007.mp3",
